{"articleNo":"88469","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=88469&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[[ 마감 ]] 2013-2학기 재단법인 두산연강재단 장학생 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.08.13","hit":"5519","attachments":[{"name":"멘토링 봉사활동 안내자료.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=88469&attachNo=3411"},{"name":"신청서류(서식).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=88469&attachNo=3413"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">[[ 마감 ]] 2013-2학기 재단법인 두산연강재단 장학생 신청 안내</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2013학년도 2학기 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">재단법인 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">두산그룹 연강재단</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"> 장학생&nbsp;선발을 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">다음과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 같이</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 안내하오니 기한까지 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 추천대상(자격요건)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2013학년도 기준 2학년 재학생으로 학업성적이 우수한 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 품행이 단정하고 가정적, 경제적 사정으로 학비 지원이 필요한 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 보호자(부모합산) 재산세 과세합계가 30만원 이하인 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;멘토로서의 자질을 갖춘 자</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #008000; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ 선발되는 장학생은 멘토링(교육봉사 주 1회 2시간 :&nbsp;활동지원비 10만원 총 10회 별도 지급) 활동에 의무적으로 참여해야하며, 휴학시장학생 취소</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 장학금액 : 등록금전액(학기별 2회 지급/</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">타 장학금 중복수혜 불가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">신청기한 및 인원 : 2013.08.16(금)까지 선착순 1명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 제출서류[붙임참조]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">장학금 수혜지원서, 추천서(1~6번사항기재) 각 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 재학증명서, 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 보호자 주민등록등본 및 재산세 (비)과세증명서(부모) 각 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 기타사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 자세한 사항은 장학생 멘토링 봉사활동 안내자료 참조[붙임]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">붙임 1. 멘토링 봉사활동 안내자료 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 신청서류(서식) 1부. 끝. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교 학생처 담당자 : 최경옥 / 전화 :&nbsp;054-478-7046</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2013.08.13</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">금오공과대학교 학생처장</span></stron